# Language-statistics overrides for GitHub Linguist.
#
# Mathematica notebooks are supporting calculations, not part of the codebase;
# their embedded cell outputs would dominate the language bar as "Wolfram
# Language". No notebook is tracked today (MATLABSpinDynamics/.gitignore and the
# root .gitignore exclude **/*.nb), and the old path-specific rule pointed at a
# MATLABSpinDynamics/SpinDynamics/ tree that no longer exists, so a generic rule
# keeps any future notebook out of the stats.
*.nb linguist-vendored

# Shell scripts are run under WSL/bash and must keep LF line endings, even when
# checked out on Windows / OneDrive. CRLF makes bash fail with errors like
# "set: pipefail: invalid option name".
*.sh text eol=lf
